          ":question/problem": "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}6x-10+3z &=2y \\\\ 20-4z &=y \\\\ 3y+9x &=12\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$",
